    <summary><strong>4. Webinar</strong></summary>
    <p>We will be hosting a webinar on 30th April 2024 at 11am. This will be an opportunity for applicants to ask questions or discuss aspects of the fund or their application. The session will be held on Microsoft Teams. Please sign up at <a href="https://www.eventbrite.co.uk/e/tay-cities-deal-tay5g-challenge-fund-2-tickets-887502633267?aff=oddtdtcreator" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Eventbrite</a>.</p>
